# boxhuman — the EXTREME-POSE test: F folds the right elbow (-132deg) and right
# knee (-120deg) to their limits, then SPACE walks DQS -> LBS -> RIGID under the
# identical pose. This is the frame that shows what the blend mode buys you:
# LBS loses volume on the inside of the knee, RIGID tears the limb into chunks.
down 30 F
up   32 F
down 150 SPACE
up   152 SPACE
down 230 SPACE
up   232 SPACE
